#: Industrial-AOV-Connector/core/preferences.py:81
msgid "You can add custom text and preset to the file name generated by Industrial AOV Connector, for example use # to customize frame number digits. You can also use $scene$, $file$, $camera$, $version$ as preset that can be automatically changed to actual names when rendering ($version$ expects there is a \"v001\" style version number at the last of your blend file name). A good example is $scene$_$version$_###"
msgstr "你可以为 Industrial AOV Connector 生成的文件名添加自定义文本和预设，例如使用 # 自定义帧号位数。还可以使用 $scene$、$file$、$camera$、$version$ 作为预设，渲染时会自动替换为实际名称（$version$ 要求你的 blend 文件名末尾有“v001”风格的版本号）。一个很好的例子是 $scene$_$version$_###"

